          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;N 53° 58.642 W 115° 47.048&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BCP648 Hard Luck Falls

Rode on quad with Aeropat to the CAP. This was a perfect finish to the weekend of events. A beautiful area and nice trail to cap for an easy find. Offered my ride to Coolcat21 and walked back with VP. The quaders came back to get us after VP and I had a nice hike 3/4 ways back so we would not get caught in the rain that never happened in our location. Thanks OFTH for giving us the opportunity to find this BCP. TFTC!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
